flowchart TD
 R[MCP request + trace ID] --> X[Redact secrets + pseudonymize tenant]
 X --> M[Metrics + traces]
 R --> T[Tool adapter]
 T --> P[Retry policy + circuit breaker]
 P -->|Safe transient retry| T
 P -->|Write operation| I[Idempotency reservation]
 I --> D[Remote provider call outside DB transaction]
 D -->|Success| C[Persist COMPLETED result]
 D -->|Ambiguous timeout/crash| Q[Reconciliation by provider key]
 Q -->|Found| C
 Q -->|Unknown| W[Keep PENDING; manual/automated recovery]
 M --> A[SLO alerts + runbooks]
